    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: planar scars and regions touched by shadow.\n\nVoidpetal has a colourless stem and a blossom so dark that its surface seems hollow. Its petals fold away from every source of light, even turning beneath one another to escape a lantern's glow. Ground with powdered pearl, the flower produces an ink-black draught that leaves the drinker's pupils ringed in grey. For 10 minutes, you gain a +2-item bonus to saving throws against Darkness and Illusion effects.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
